      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Anchor migration provenance in this commit's ancestry**\n\nReleasing this exact revision is blocked because `9ddd014b...` and `e95e066a...` are sibling commits with the same parent, not an ancestor/descendant pair. The production release loader explicitly runs `git merge-base --is-ancestor introducedBy <release SHA>` for every manifest entry and refuses the release when it fails, so this critical privacy migration cannot be deployed from the reviewed commit. Preserve `9ddd014b...` through an actual merge or anchor this entry to a commit that is in the release ancestry.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
